@startuml
title Query → Temporal Multi-Hop Analytics (Sequence)

actor User
participant Planner
participant "Hybrid Retriever\n(FAISS ∧ BM25)" as Ret
database "Indexes\nFAISS / ES" as Idx
collections "Docs\n(Parquet)" as Docs
participant "FinBERT" as Sent
participant "BERTopic" as Topics
participant "Aggregator" as Agg
participant "External Signals" as Ext
participant "LLM Synthesizer" as LLM
participant "Evaluator" as Eval

User -> Planner : Q: "How did opinion on X change 2007–2015?"
Planner --> User : Plan {periods, aspect_queries, topK}
loop for each period
  Planner -> Ret : retrieve(period, queries)
  Ret -> Idx : ANN + BM25 (year-filtered)
  Idx --> Ret : candidate ids
  Ret -> Docs : fetch texts
  Ret --> Planner : docs(period)
  Planner -> Sent : score(docs(period))
  Planner -> Topics : cluster(docs(period))
end
Planner -> Agg : combine {sentiment per period, topics, exemplars}
Agg -> Ext : (optional) fetch series (stock, GDP, Trends)
Ext --> Agg : aligned external signals
Agg -> LLM : metrics + exemplars (+ signals)
LLM --> User : concise, cited summary
Planner -> Eval : log hit-rate, temporal fidelity, drift
Eval --> User : quality metrics (dashboard)

@enduml